# Shared secret that lets trusted clients (the MCP gateway, the bridge) record
# privileged audit trust levels (gateway_enforced, managed_client). Leave empty
# for local dev to honor the client-identity header alone; set a strong value in
# shared or production deployments so trust labels cannot be forged.
